### List users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Get a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Get the current user (200; must contain "preferredCategories")
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Update the profile (200; blank name or non-http avatar gives 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Replace the preferences (200; empty list gives 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/preferences
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categories": ["MUSIC", "TECH"]}

### Empty preferences (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/preferences
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categories": []}